SUMMARY: Alex’s Lemonade Stand Foundation’s The Million Mile
DESCRIPTION:\nMake the miles you pedal count!\n\nThis Childhood Cancer Aw
 areness month you can make a difference for kids with cancer by joining T
 he Million Mile.\n\nThe Million Mile https://www.alexslemonade.org/campai
 gn/the-million-mile-2026 is a month-long virtual challenge that funds cri
 tical childhood cancer research. Whether you walk\, cycle\, or run\, YOU 
 can go the distance for children fighting cancer. Participants of all age
 s and abilities are encouraged to log miles throughout September while ra
 ising money to help kids with cancer.\n\nOur goal is to collectively move
  a million miles this September. Register now and join The Million Mile t
 oday for free!
CATEGORIES:Community,Charity-Event
