SUMMARY: Southside Creekways Project Summit
DESCRIPTION:The City of Grand Rapids Parks and Recreation Department is i
 nviting you and your fellow residents\, business owners and neighborhood 
 groups to the free\, family-friendly Southside Creekways Project Summit S
 ept. 9. At the summit\, attendees can explore the project process\, learn
  how community feedback guides City projects and help shape the next phas
 e of one of the City’s most significant neighborhood trail efforts.\n\nWh
 en: Noon to 8 p.m. Wednesday\, Sept. 9\n\nWhere: MLK Park Community Cente
 r\, 900 Fuller Ave. SE\n\nhttps://www.grandrapidsmi.gov/city-news/posts/s
 outhside-creekways-summit-invites-community-to-learn-what-s-next-and-guid
 e-the-project-s-future/ https://www.grandrapidsmi.gov/city-news/posts/sou
 thside-creekways-summit-invites-community-to-learn-what-s-next-and-guide-
 the-project-s-future/\n\npublicinput.com/southsidecreekways https://publi
 cinput.com/southsidecreekways
CATEGORIES:Advocacy
