SUMMARY: Kentwood Challenger
DESCRIPTION:Weekly no-drop road group ride from Challenger Elementary in 
 Kentwood.\n\nHosted by Rapid Wheelmen https://ridewithgps.com/organizatio
 ns/15163-rapid-wheelmen\n\nRequirements to ride:\n\n  * Rapid Wheelmen Me
 mbership\n  * New Members are welcome and can sign a waiver for their fir
 st ride\n  * Proper Bicycle Helmet\n  * Lights (a front light is required
  when riding past sunset)\n\nGroup Speeds:\nA: 19-22 mph\nB: 17-19 mph\nC
 : 14-16mph\n\nStart time:\n\n  * B and C Groups at 6:20pm\n  * A Group at
  6:30pm\n\n
