SUMMARY: PEDALS 2026
DESCRIPTION:PEDALS 2026\n\nMark your calendar for PEDALS 2026! We hope yo
 u can participate in this epic event to raise funds for those living with
  ALS.\n\nIf you love cycling\, running and walking for a cause\, come on 
 out to Townsend Park on September 13th to participate in one of PedALS mu
 ltiple bike events which include a 100k Iron Horse road ride\, 20-mile ro
 ad ride\, 32-mile gravel ride\,16-mile bike mountain ride\, 5k or 1-mile 
 walk. The walk/run/roll is a family fun event so bring all your family an
 d friends! After the bike/run/walk/roll\, we will celebrate the day with 
 lunch\, drinks\, music\, and lots of activities for the kids including ba
 lloon artists\, face painting\, yard games\, and so much more!\n\nWhether
  you choose to sponsor\, donate\, bike/walk/run/roll\, or volunteer\, you
  are helping to make a difference in the lives of the ALS families we ass
 ist.\n\nThank you for your support!\n\npedalsforals.com/ https://pedalsfo
 rals.com/
CATEGORIES:Annual-Event,Charity-Event,Race,Sunday
