SUMMARY: Wednesday Evening Rides
DESCRIPTION:Each week takes us on a casual 10-12 mile ride through the st
 reets of Grand Rapids for exploration\, socializing\, and cycling visibil
 ity. We typically finish the ride at the Monarchs Club.\n\nBring a functi
 oning bike\, a good helmet\, and lights for your bike. First time rider? 
 That's okay - we're a friendly bunch\, and this is a no-drop ride. That m
 eans we won't leave you behind\, no matter what.\n\nThe ride is open to a
 ll\, but please keep in mind that you're responsible for your own actions
 . Don't ride like a jerk. Do smile and have a good time. Have any questio
 ns? Seek out the ride leader.\n\nMeets in Veterans Memorial Park (101 Ful
 ton St E) at 8:00 pm every Wednesday night.
CATEGORIES:Group-Ride,Wednesday,Non-Drop
