SUMMARY: 2026 Ride Around Kent County
DESCRIPTION:145 miles touching the 4 corners of Kent County. Shorter dist
 ances (90-120 miles) may be achieved with a "SAG forward."\n\nThere are a
 t least two groups: "Fast" (18+ average mph) and "Good" (15+ average mph)
 . Slower paced riders will not finish the 145 mile route by the 6pm cut-o
 ff.\n\nSAG\, snacks\, ice\, and sports drinks all around the route. Lunch
  for 145-milers about half-way around. Sandwich provided for 100-milers.\
 n\nLunch sandwiches will contain chicken and possibly nuts. Peanut butter
 \, jelly\, bread\, bananas\, oranges\, trail mix\, and "Aussie Bites" and
 /or "Sunrise bars" (organic energy bars) will be available as alternative
 s. If these options don't meet your dietary needs\, then we welcome you t
 o bring your own nutrition and our SAG vehicles will carry it to the lunc
 h stop for you. Be sure to mark your name and phone number on the contain
 er!\n\nwww.bikesignup.com/Race/MI/Walker/RideAroundKentCounty https://www
 .bikesignup.com/Race/MI/Walker/RideAroundKentCounty
CATEGORIES:Annual-Event,Race,Saturday
