DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an exhilarating day of gravel racing at The Dir
 ty Mitten Gravel Bike Race on Saturday\, September 19th\, 2026! Set in th
 e picturesque town of Middleville\, Barry\, this event is the perfect way
  to embrace the vibrant spirit of early fall. The race starts and finishe
 s at the scenic YMCA's Camp Manitou-Lin\, conveniently located between Gr
 and Rapids and Kalamazoo\, making it accessible for cyclists from all ove
 r West Michigan.\n\nAs a proud member of the Boundless RR Co. Grand Prix 
 and a highlight of the I Love Gravel Racing Series\, The Dirty Mitten pro
 mises an unforgettable experience for both competitors and spectators ali
 ke. Join fellow enthusiasts for a day filled with camaraderie\, stunning 
 views\, and the thrill of the race. Whether you're a seasoned racer or a 
 first-time participant\, this event is not to be missed! Grab your bike a
 nd gear up for an adventure on the gravel!\n\nthedirtymitten.com/the-dirt
 y-mitten-gravel-bike-race/ https://thedirtymitten.com/the-dirty-mitten-gr
 avel-bike-race/
