SUMMARY: The Ride H.O.M.E.
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for the 3rd annual The Ride H.O.M.E. - Hart\, Oc
 eana\, Montague Experience held on the William Field Memorial Rail Trail 
 starting in downtown Hart!\n\nWe offer an out and back rail trail ride on
  the majestic William Field Memorial Rail Trail\, you choose the distance
 . Aid stations packed with snacks and drinks will be available throughout
  from Hart to Whitehall!\n\nIncluded in your entry is a t-shirt and post 
 event food so what are you waiting for? Sign up https://www.bikereg.com/7
 4161 today and take advantage of early bird pricing!\n\nA portion of the 
 proceeds will go to the Pentwater Hart Trail project.\n\nEarly bird prici
 ng\, don't wait until the cost goes up!
