SUMMARY: Kent County Road Commission Meeting
DESCRIPTION:If you care about making our community safer and more accessi
 ble for people who bike\, this is the place to be. Civic meetings like th
 e Kent County Road Commission Meeting https://www.kentcountyroads.net/abo
 ut/our_board/agendas_minutes.php are where real decisions get made about 
 street design\, infrastructure funding\, and transportation priorities. B
 y showing up\, you lend your voice to the push for better bike lanes\, sa
 fer intersections\, and more equitable mobility options. Whether you’re a
  daily commuter\, a weekend rider\, or simply believe in sustainable tran
 sportation\, your participation helps ensure that bicyclists are part of 
 the conversation - and the solution.
