SUMMARY: Ada Park Thursday Group Ride
DESCRIPTION:ALL SKILL LEVELS WELCOME.\n\nNOBODY RIDES ALONE OFF THE BACK.
 \n\nThis is a no-drop ride - experienced riders use it as a zone 2 effort
  and help new riders feel comfortable. We'll have regroup and sprint sect
 ions along the way\, so it doesn't matter if you're chasing a PR or just 
 getting back into the saddle. Routes run 20-30 miles out of Ada. Bring a 
 spare tube\, lights if it's dim\, and a bike that's ready to roll.
