SUMMARY: 11th Annual CDR
DESCRIPTION:Pickle Dog Ride? Nope it's the11th Annual Corn Dog Ride\, we 
 leave the parking lot at 750 Front St. at 10 am.\n\nIf you arrive after 1
 0 catch us on Monroe or the White Pine.\n\nIt is a 25 mile ride to Sand L
 ake for the 4th of July festival.\n\nWe will stop about half way in Rockf
 ord at Richardson-Sowerby Park. It is to the right just after you cross t
 he Rouge River Bridge\, south of 10 Mile.\n\nWe then continue to Sand Lak
 e for the festival. We will spend about 1 hr before heading back into tow
 n. FYI there is plenty of parking at EPS if you choose to drive to the st
 art.\n\nBring cash money.
CATEGORIES:Annual-Event,Group-Ride
